  "limitations": [
    "Raw FP storage is from existing verified manifests, not fresh per-file stat/hash audit.",
    "FP embeddings represent acoustic simulations; ray profiles represent binary floorplan geometry. Storage ratio is not an information-equivalence or accuracy claim.",
    "Ray banks store36 world directions per XY; candidate yaw uses index rotation. No dense pose-by-ray tensor is saved.",
    "Original FP rendering and feature-extraction wall time not measured here.",
    "Geometry timing covers both20cm and10cm generation together and cannot be called pure20cm latency.",
    "Training, query encoders, B2/GEOQ execution, model weights and common floorplan image storage excluded from these bank figures.",
    "No performance/cost decision until matched accuracy and isolated runtime measurements."
